{"id":"e548027ea9dbef59","group":"58","path":"58/batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md","title":"Metric Tensor","display":"df-metric-tensor — Metric Tensor","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-metric-tensor","aliases":["58-df-metric-tensor"],"display":"df-metric-tensor — Metric Tensor","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-metric-tensor"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-metric-tensor</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-metric-tensor — Metric Tensor"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"71fe0dc4c8613e69\" href=\"?note=71fe0dc4c8613e69\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md\">../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5f44e08576c6b2e\" href=\"?note=c5f44e08576c6b2e\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md\">../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,M\\in V\">\\(g,M\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\\)</span> 保留二元存在结构接口。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\">\\(\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)\\)</span> 使用书内 <code>58-df-smooth-tensor-data</code> 的实双线性、光滑性和正定性定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\">\\(S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>需要在多个构造间共用流形结构的调用者使用显式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 版本，不分别量化切空间、张量场和度量结构。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>度量仍为光滑、对称、正定的实协变二阶张量；双线性、光滑张量集合和切空间零元已由内部关系定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md","status":"resolved","id":"71fe0dc4c8613e69","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-smooth-manifold.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5f44e08576c6b2e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-smooth-tensor-data.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"g,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,S)","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\omega_{>0}\\;\\exists\\tau,\\mathcal A\\;\n\\mathrm{MetricTensorData}_{58}(g,\\langle M,\\tau,\\mathcal A,n\\rangle).","display":true}],"bytes":1058,"backlinks":[{"id":"04b9f5c6479b7ecd","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MetricTensor}_S(g,M)$ (Riemannian metric-tensor predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-841","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-metric-tensor.md|58-df-metric-tensor]]（batch17）"}],"outgoing":["71fe0dc4c8613e69","c5f44e08576c6b2e"]}